$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=carmsev  LOC_AFTER=?

* At the paper's exact scales the search outputs a certified Carmichael number in ( n , n ^ ( 1 + A ) ] within the operation budget, for all large n (Lean: carmichaelSearch_eventually of SearchAlg.lean).

